# The vendored MITRE F3 catalogue is source, not generated output: without it
# core.taxonomy cannot load. COVERAGE.md is committed too, so CI can check the
# published matrix still matches the registered rules. coverage.json stays
# ignored — it is regenerated from the same command.
!app/core/taxonomy/f3_catalogue.json
